sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Animator as Animator / User
    participant Timeline as TimelineController (Single Clock)
    participant Skeleton as SkeletonRenderer (CoreSkeleton27)
    participant VRM as VrmManager (VRM Humanoid)
    participant Stage as ViewerStage (WebGLRenderer)

    Note over Timeline,Stage: One Unified Motion Payload Sourced from ARDY Inference
    
    Animator->>Timeline: Play / Seek to frameIndex
    loop Every requestAnimationFrame
        Timeline->>Timeline: update(deltaSeconds * playbackSpeed)
        Timeline-->>Timeline: currentFrame = floor(currentTime * 20.0 FPS)
        
        par Skeleton Joint Update
            Timeline->>Skeleton: updateFrame(currentFrame)
            Skeleton->>Skeleton: Position joint spheres (x, y, z)
            Skeleton->>Skeleton: Update LineSegments buffer positions
        and VRM Humanoid Update
            Timeline->>VRM: updateFrame(currentFrame, delta)
            VRM->>VRM: Apply bone quaternions (x, y, z, w)
            VRM->>VRM: Apply hips root translation (rx, ry, rz)
            VRM->>VRM: vrm.update(delta) (Spring bones & constraints)
        end

        Timeline->>Stage: render()
        Stage->>Stage: OrbitControls.update()
        Stage->>Stage: WebGLRenderer.render(scene, camera)
    end
